Selected story/work item: **US-074 Student TARA order submission action**.  
Lane: **high-risk** because it touches auth, authorization, data model, public contracts, existing behavior, and currently has injected/unit proof rather than provider-backed proof.

Implemented one bounded vertical slice:

- Added the bounded injected submission executor at `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/student-tara-order-submission-action.ts:78`.
  - Requires `student` role.
  - Requires class/fund/month scope.
  - Parses authoritative current fund, holding, pending-order, and tracked-metric rows before use.
  - Rejects duplicate pending orders.
  - Validates target weights through the existing domain receipt/envelope path.
  - Calls an injected pending-order writer.
  - Parses the persisted pending-order row and verifies it matches the command before returning the existing student-safe result envelope.
- Added unit proof in `app/infrastructure/auth-tenancy/student-tara-order-submission-action.test.ts`.
  - Covered successful scoped submission, non-student denial before writes, invalid target allocation safe failure, duplicate pending-order rejection, persisted row scope rejection, and persisted command mismatch.
